\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Offline VigiDroid model-development pipeline. The PC-side workflow indexes APKs, extracts features, trains and exports ONNX bundles, and organizes the exported detectors into LIGHT, MID, and HEAVY inference tiers.}}{15}{figure.caption.4}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.2}{\ignorespaces VigiDroid on-device application flow. The app selects a scan depth, runs the corresponding model tiers through local feature extraction and ONNX Runtime inference, fuses model scores, reports a verdict, and writes resource metrics for post-device analysis.}}{16}{figure.caption.5}%
